      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm looking at the side effect report from the trial... it shows a bit of an uptick in nausea compared to the control group. Are you sure we can call it a \"superior side effect profile\" for comfort? I don't want us getting flagged by regulators if we're claiming it's better for comfort when patients are actually feeling sick.",
